# Runtime settings belong in .dev.vars for local Pages development.
# Copy .dev.vars.example to .dev.vars; never commit real credentials.
# Production API keys: Cloudflare Pages -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets.
# Production GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and model names: Cloudflare dashboard variables.
# The frontend reads the public GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID from /api/config at runtime.
# Do not create VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY or VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY.
